message: If you use this work, please cite it.
title: Standard Model Lagrangian Specifications with Right-Handed Neutrinos
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Paul
    family-names: Barrett
    affiliation: Byt-wyze
abstract: >-
  A fully expanded, gauge-fixed Standard Model Lagrangian with three
  sterile right-handed neutrinos and Dirac neutrino masses, including
  the complete Faddeev-Popov ghost sector and a machine verification
  report.
keywords:
  - Standard Model
  - Lagrangian
  - right-handed neutrinos
  - Dirac neutrinos
  - Faddeev-Popov ghosts
  - electroweak theory
  - machine verification
